 # Deploying
 
-Run `make deploy`.
+1. Make sure CI is green on `main`.
+2. Run `make deploy ENV=staging` and check the staging site.
+3. Run `make deploy ENV=production`.
+
+If a deploy fails, `make rollback ENV=production` restores the previous release.
